   b4) 1 = 5^0.
   b5) 5 = 5^1.
   b6) 25 = 5^2.
   b7) 125 = 5^3.
   b8) 625 = 5^4.
c) Base 10:
   c1) 10 = 10^1.
   c2) 0.1 = 10^{-1}.
   c3) 0.001 = 10^{-3}.
   c4) 0.00001 = 10^{-5}.
   c5) 0.0000001 = 10^{-7}.

There are 21 separate conversions: 8+8+5, not three scalar results.
